Purchasing from this
link supports Knit it Now.

50
00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:40.260
Thank you for watching and look for many

51
00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:45.880
more tutorials in the extensive
Knit It Now Learning Library.

52
00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:49.940
Here's a link to all
the tutorials in this series.

53
00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:50.720
Happy charting.

